# Form: verification and closeout

Use for durable acceptance/evidence where a short task result is insufficient.
Default output: existing evidence family, or `docs/research/<scope>-verification.md`.
Copy payload only; fill [metadata](../../references/metadata.md). Essential: exact
subject/identity, method, real results/limits, verdict scope and remaining action.
Remove irrelevant platform/artifact columns, not unknown/unrun distinctions. No
reviewer-of-reviewer chain; this form grants neither execution nor commit authority.
Use only applicable rows/sections; an unknown mandatory fact is not N/A. Evidence
meaning belongs to [quality](../../references/quality.md), agreed delivery transitions
to [artifact-delivery](../../references/methods/artifact-delivery.md).

